platform=hero('Platform','A foundation for<br>AI you operate.','The Sovereign AI Appliance is Solas’s long-term product direction: bringing private AI capabilities together on infrastructure an organization controls.')
platform+='''<section class="section"><div class="wrap platform-layout"><div><span class="status">IN DEVELOPMENT · NOT YET FOR SALE</span><h2>The Sovereign<br>AI Appliance.</h2><p class="lead" style="margin-top:25px">A planned platform for local inference, private knowledge systems, and governed access to AI.</p><p>The aim is to make private AI easier to deploy and operate, with a system your team can run independently. Capabilities and deployment options are being developed and evaluated.</p><div class="note"><h3>Advisory is available today.</h3><p>You can engage Solas now for assessment, architecture, governance, and implementation. The appliance is a separate development effort.</p></div></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Planned capability areas</p><ul class="feature-list"><li>Local model inference</li><li>Private document intelligence and enterprise search</li><li>Meeting transcription and private assistants</li><li>Audit logging and role-based permissions</li><li>Enterprise identity and SSO integration</li><li>On-premises, hybrid, and air-gapped deployment options</li></ul><p class="subtle" style="margin-top:20px">These are development goals, not a list of currently available product features.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Exploratory R&amp;D</p><h2>Related directions.</h2><p class="lead">Early areas of exploration around infrastructure and intelligence. These are not available products.</p></div><div><article class="research-item"><h3>AI Infrastructure Observatory</h3><p>Tracking compute, data centers, power, and the physical footprint of AI infrastructure.</p></article><article class="research-item"><h3>Semantic News Systems</h3><p>Exploring persistent intelligence drawn from news, research, and reports.</p></article><article class="research-item"><h3>ESG Intelligence</h3><p>Environmental and sustainability intelligence with traceable source information.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="collaborate"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Build with Solas</p><h2>Help shape<br>what comes next.</h2></div><div><p class="lead" style="margin-top:0">We welcome conversations with design partners, potential pilot customers, technical collaborators, and prospective technical co-founders.</p><p>Bring a real operational problem, relevant technical experience, or a perspective on what private AI should make possible. We can explore whether there is a useful fit.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="mailto:contact@solassovereignsystems.ai?subject=Solas%20platform%20collaboration">Discuss a collaboration <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></div></section>'''+cta('Need private AI support today?','Explore an advisory or implementation engagement while the platform takes shape.')
